<title>POLAND: Kety considers share or bond issue 1997.</title>
<headline>Kety considers share or bond issue 1997.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish aluminium plant Kety SA considers a new share or convertible bond issue next year, the company's deputy president said.</p>
<p>&quot;The management is considering a share or convertible bonds issue next year,&quot; Boleslaw Mleczko told Reuters, but said it was too early to give any details.</p>
<p>He said that the funds from the issue would be used for investment.</p>
<p>-- Malgorzata Rzepka +48 22 653 9700</p>
